anna (devex): thanks everyone. I'll @mention reviewers in PR and include the edge-case examples above. If anyone has objections to the normalize behavior (null->undefined) speak now — otherwise I'll land the helper with a deprecation note for null-preserving callers.

mike (eng-sdk): no objections. prefer null->undefined for JS ergonomics. add a small flag to preserveNulls for callers that need the raw signal.

ravi (eng-ml): SGTM. for Go we'll expose both normalized and raw models in the generator.

anna (devex): perfect. wrapping up, will assign reviewers and post PR link shortly. thanks :heart:
